Waiting is the sort of thing you might need to do several times in a row, so
you can abbreviate it with the number 0, or click the middle of the compass
rose.

(Cuneiform did not have a number zero, but scholars sometimes use 0 or OO to
transcribe a meaningful blank spot on the tablet, like in place-value numbers
or tables of data.)

