> isnan islimani tehhun
N=an išlimani natta tēḫḫun. Nu=ši GA.KIN.AG anda natta ēšta. Nu=ši šēšaš anda
natta ēšta.

The narrator is apparently trying to make iyatti, a kind of bread “studded”
with chopped pieces of fruit and cheese.

Nu LU₂^ḫalliyatallaš ištarniya palši šarāzziyaz palšaz pait.

- - - - -
